1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,056
Welcome to the Space Lab demo.

2
00:00:02,156 --> 00:00:05,663
This is Stargazer, my research ship
on its way to the Shattered Planet.

3
00:00:05,763 --> 00:00:08,676
It produces all the resources it needs
from asteroids.

4
00:00:09,517 --> 00:00:11,910
Collectors on the front edge
catch asteroid chunks.

5
00:00:13,517 --> 00:00:17,081
Asteroids are processed separately by type,
for easier management.

6
00:00:18,433 --> 00:00:22,688
Space Lab adds a new recipe that also
gives stone from regular asteroids.

7
00:00:24,933 --> 00:00:28,643
A new recipe, Shattered Synthesis,
crushes the red promethium chunks.

8
00:00:28,743 --> 00:00:31,834
It yields tungsten, holmium,
and a new mineral: Flurolite.

9
00:00:33,550 --> 00:00:36,811
Cryogenic plants make ammonia
from stone, water and steam.

10
00:00:40,050 --> 00:00:42,690
Flurolite is split into
lithium brine and fluorine.

11
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:48,785
This is the Growth Facility,
the new building.

12
00:00:48,885 --> 00:00:50,360
It incubates eggs in orbit.

13
00:00:53,017 --> 00:00:56,207
One biter egg becomes nineteen,
and they don't spoil inside.

14
00:00:59,517 --> 00:01:02,308
It also grows Yumako
and Jellynut from seeds.

15
00:01:02,408 --> 00:01:04,580
Biochambers turn them into nutrients.

16
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:08,925
Agricultural science
can now be made in space.

17
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:16,485
Cryogenic science no longer needs
Aquilo's special conditions.

18
00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:22,920
Electromagnetic science can also
be produced without limitations.

19
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:29,293
Metallurgic science no longer
needs to be made on Vulcanus.

20
00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:34,723
These locally made packs
feed twenty-four labs.

21
00:01:34,823 --> 00:01:36,911
It's a complete science chain
in deep space.

22
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:40,633
That's Space Lab.
Thanks for watching!
